  "crash_cause": "EXCEPTION_ACCESS_VIOLATION reading address 0xffffffffffffffff (null pointer dereference) inside UArenaScoreTracker::AddPoints() (Source/PixelArena/ArenaScoreTracker.cpp:18), triggered from AArenaGameMode::OnGoalScored() the first time a goal is scored (~1 minute in). The packaged Shipping build has no null guard on the ScoreTracker/Stats/Hud subsystems in OnGoalScored, so a goal while a subsystem is missing dereferences a null pointer and crashes.",
  "no_colors_cause": "The arena palette asset /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary is not present in the packaged build, so the runtime LoadObject in AArenaGameMode::BeginPlay fails (LogStreaming: Couldn't find file for package /Game/Data/Palettes/DA_Primary) and the game falls back to gray. Root cause: Config/DefaultGame.ini has bCookAll=False and /Game/Data/Palettes was not listed in DirectoriesToAlwaysCook (only /Game/Data/Effects was), so the palette, which is loaded at runtime and not referenced at cook time, was never cooked into the pak."
